  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "なぞに　つつまれた　ＵＢの　いっしゅ。\nまちゆく　ひとが　きせいされ\nあばれだす　すがたが　もくげきされた。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "수수께끼에 싸인 UB의 일종.\n길을 가던 사람이 기생 당해\n난폭해지는 모습이 목격되었다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "是充滿謎團的ＵＢ的一種。\n有人曾目擊到走在街上的路人\n被寄生後暴走的模樣。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "L’une des mystérieuses Ultra-Chimères.\nOn l’aurait vue parasiter des gens en pleine\nrue, les rendant extrêmement violents.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Eine rätselhafte Ultrabestie. Einigen Berichten\nzufolge verwandelt sie harmlose Stadtbewohner\nper Symbiose in äußerst aggressive Menschen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Un Ultraente envuelto en misterio. Se dice que\nlas víctimas a las que posee se vuelven\nagresivas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Una delle misteriose Ultracreature. Si riportano\ncasi in cui le persone vittime di questo parassita\nhanno manifestato comportamenti violenti.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "One of several mysterious Ultra Beasts. People\non the street report observing those infested\nby it suddenly becoming violent.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "謎に　包まれた　ＵＢの　一種。\n街ゆく　人が　寄生され\n暴れだす　姿が　目撃された。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "被谜团包围的究极异兽的一种。\n有人目击了街上的人们\n被寄生后暴走起来的样子。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Un Ultraente envuelto en misterio. Se dice que\nlas víctimas a las que posee se vuelven\nagresivas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ＵＢの　いっしゅ。　いしが　あるかは\nふめいだが　ときおり　しょうじょの\nような　しぐさを　みせる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "UB의 일종. 의지가 있는지는\n불명확하지만 가끔\n소녀 같은 행동을 보인다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ＵＢ的一種。\n是否有自主意識尚不清楚，\n但不時會展現少女般的姿態。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Nul ne sait si cette Ultra-Chimère possède\nune conscience propre, mais on l’aurait aperçue\nen train d’imiter les gestes d’une jeune fille.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Eine Ultrabestie, die gelegentlich das Verhalten\neines jungen Mädchens an den Tag legt. Es ist\nnicht bekannt, ob sie dies bewusst tut.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se desconoce si este Ultraente posee\nconsciencia propia, pero en ocasiones se\ncomporta como una chica joven.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Una delle Ultracreature. Non è noto se abbia\nuna volontà propria, ma talvolta sembra imitare\nil comportamento di una ragazzina.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "One of the Ultra Beasts. It’s unclear whether or\nnot this Pokémon is sentient, but sometimes it\ncan be observed behaving like a young girl.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ＵＢの　一種。　意思が　あるかは\n不明だが　時折　少女の\nような　仕草を　みせる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "究极异兽中的一种。\n是否有自主意识尚不清楚，\n但时不时会展现少女般的姿态。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se desconoce si este Ultraente posee\nconsciencia propia, pero en ocasiones se\ncomporta como una chica joven.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ＵＢと　よばれる　べつせかいの\nせいめいたい。　つよい　しんけいどくを\nもっていると　かんがえられる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "UB라고 불리는 다른 세계의\n생명체다. 강한 신경독을\n갖고 있을 것으로 추정된다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "被稱為究極異獸，\n是來自其他世界的生命體。\n被認為擁有強烈的神經毒。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Une forme de vie d’un autre monde,\ncommunément appelée « Ultra-Chimère ».\nOn la pense porteuse d’une violente neurotoxine.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Eines der Lebewesen aus einer anderen Welt,\ndie Ultrabestien genannt werden. Man glaubt,\ndass es über ein starkes Nervengift verfüge.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Una forma de vida de otro mundo conocida\ncomo Ultraente. Se cree que posee una\nneurotoxina muy potente.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Una delle forme di vita provenienti da un altro\nmondo, chiamate Ultracreature. Si pensa che\nproduca una neurotossina.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "A life-form from another world, it was dubbed\na UB and is thought to produce a\nstrong neurotoxin.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ＵＢと　呼ばれる　別世界の\n生命体。　強い　神経毒を\n持っていると　考えられる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "是被称为究极异兽的\n其他世界的生命体。\n被认为拥有强力的神经毒素。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Una forma de vida de otro mundo conocida\ncomo Ultraente. Se cree que posee una\nneurotoxina muy potente.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ウルトラホールから　このせかいに\nあらわれた。　ポケモンや　にんげんに\nきせいして　いきているようだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "울트라홀을 통해 이 세계에\n나타났다. 포켓몬이나 인간에게\n기생해서 사는 듯하다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "從究極之洞中現身來到\n這個世界。似乎會靠寄生在\n寶可夢或人類身上來生存。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il est venu dans ce monde à travers une\nUltra-Brèche. Tel un parasite, il aurait besoin\nd’un hôte, Pokémon ou humain, pour survivre.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Anego kam durch eine Ultrapforte in diese Welt.\nEs scheint ein Parasit zu sein, der Pokémon\nund Menschen befällt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Llegó a este mundo a través de un Ultraumbral.\nEs un parásito que se aprovecha de Pokémon y\npersonas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È arrivato in questo mondo attraverso un\nUltravarco. È un parassita di Pokémon\ned esseri umani.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It appeared in this world from an Ultra\nWormhole. Nihilego appears to be a parasite\nthat lives by feeding on people and Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ウルトラホールから　この世界に\n現れた。　ポケモンや　人間に\n寄生して　生きているようだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "从究极之洞出现，来到这个世界。\n好像会寄生在宝可梦或\n人类的身上生存下去。",
